---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  canonical="cosme-vs-parilio-paros.html"
  title="Cosme or Parīlio | Suites With Keith"
  description="Paros' two best hotels are ten minutes apart and nothing alike. Keith toured both back to back — here's how to decide in thirty seconds."
  current="compare"
  preload="/images/hotels/parilio-1.jpg"
>

<header class="section" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">Head-to-head &middot; Paros, Greece</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl reveal" style="margin-top:18px; max-width:14ch;">Cosme or <em style="font-style:italic; color:var(--brass);">Par&imacr;lio?</em></h1>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin-top:22px; max-width:44ch;">Ten minutes apart, nothing alike, and the pair I&rsquo;m asked to choose between more than any other in Greece. I toured both on the same trip, back to back. Once you know which problem is yours, the decision takes thirty seconds.</p>
    <p class="stamp reveal" style="margin-top:26px;">Toured back-to-back &middot; same trip &middot; both Fora partners</p>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- the 30-second answer -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="choose reveal">
      <div class="choose-col">
        <span class="eyebrow">Choose Cosme</span>
        <h3>If you want to walk to dinner</h3>
        <p class="lead">A true beach during the day, Naousa&rsquo;s restaurants on foot at night, and no car keys all week. Warm, colorful, social.</p>
        <figure style="margin:24px 0 0;"><img src="/images/hotels/cosme-2.jpg" alt="Cosme, Paros" width="1800" height="1013" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="aspect-ratio:16/10; object-fit:cover;" /></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="choose-col">
        <span class="eyebrow">Choose Par&imacr;lio</span>
        <h3>If you want to be alone</h3>
        <p class="lead">Contemporary Cycladic architecture, calm interiors, and a private pool you&rsquo;ll actually spend the afternoon in. Calm, architectural, private.</p>
        <figure style="margin:24px 0 0;"><img src="/images/hotels/parilio-1.jpg" alt="Parīlio, Paros" width="1800" height="1013" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="aspect-ratio:16/10; object-fit:cover;" /></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- the table -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Side by side</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">How they compare</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrap reveal">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th></th><th>Cosme</th><th>Par&imacr;lio</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="rowlabel">Setting</td><td>Beachfront, walk to Naousa</td><td>Inland, minutes from Naousa by car</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="rowlabel">Mood</td><td>Warm, colorful, social</td><td>Calm, architectural, private</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="rowlabel">Beach</td><td>On site, private club out front</td><td>Complimentary sunbeds at Cosme</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="rowlabel">Room I&rsquo;d book</td><td>Base room or Enastro Suite for privacy</td><td>Sun Suite with private pool</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="rowlabel">From</td><td>$950 / night</td><td>$900 / night</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="rowlabel">Honeymoon</td><td>If you want to be out at night</td><td>If you want to be alone</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="body-2 reveal small" style="margin-top:18px; max-width:62ch;">Both are the same group, both Fora preferred partners &mdash; upgrade on arrival where available, daily breakfast, €100 hotel credit &mdash; and Par&imacr;lio guests share Cosme&rsquo;s beach club, which quietly means you never fully have to choose.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- the honeymoon answer -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">The question behind the question</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">For a honeymoon: Par&imacr;lio, most of the time.</h2>
    <p class="body-2 reveal" style="margin-top:22px; max-width:56ch;">Specifically a Sun Suite with a private pool &mdash; the privacy is the point, and the outdoor space means an entire afternoon without seeing anyone. But if the version of the trip you&rsquo;re picturing involves walking to dinner and staying out afterward, Cosme is the better fit, and you&rsquo;ll use the location every single evening.</p>
    <p class="body-2 reveal" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:56ch;">And if you can&rsquo;t choose at all, the better question is whether you should be doing two islands. The same group opened Er&emacr;ma on Milos &mdash; Paros then Milos is the trip I&rsquo;d actually book.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- the ask -->
<section class="section inquire" id="inquire">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Still deciding?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:42ch;">Tell me your dates and I&rsquo;ll tell you which one has the room worth having &mdash; same rate you&rsquo;d pay booking direct, sometimes better.</p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Cosme vs Parilio Inquiry" />
      <input type="hidden" name="hotel" value="Cosme / Parilio, Paros" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="cosme-vs-parilio-paros" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when">When are you thinking?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="September, 6 nights" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name">And where do I send the recommendation?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Send</button>
      <p class="note">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
